			"x": 0,
			"y": -320,
			"width": 1600,
			"height": 240,
			"text": "# Malphas\nMalphas, a tall predatory warlock in his fifties, black hair swept back, a pale sharp face, a black velvet coat, eyes like a starless sky\n\nEverything about Malphas, top to bottom. Right-click a recipe card to make its art; it saves into `characters/malphas/art/`. Make them in order: room and actor, then the moods, then the talking loops, then the booth."
